# CommonVeil Environment Configuration
#
# By default, CommonVeil requires ZERO environment variables in production.
# The application connects to Midnight Preprod using the standard Midnight
# Browser Connector API v4, deriving the indexer, indexer-ws, and proof
# endpoints directly from the user's connected wallet (e.g., Lace / 1AM).
#
# IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTICE:
# Never embed private Blockfrost API keys or production secrets in VITE_*
# variables. Any variable prefixed with VITE_* is baked directly into client-side
# JavaScript bundles during `npm run build` and is visible to any browser visitor.
#
# OPTIONAL LOCAL DEVELOPER OVERRIDE ONLY:
# For local development or automated headless testing where no wallet extension
# provides indexer configuration, you may optionally set a local Blockfrost override
# in your untracked `.env.local` file (never commit `.env.local`).
#
# VITE_INDEXER_URI=https://midnight-preprod.blockfrost.io/api/v0?project_id=YOUR_LOCAL_DEV_KEY
# VITE_INDEXER_WS_URI=wss://midnight-preprod.blockfrost.io/api/v0/ws?project_id=YOUR_LOCAL_DEV_KEY
